--- task
id: s02
dataset: social
kind: group by a property
answer: fewest

--- intent
How many people live in each city? Return the city and the number of people as `people`, sorted by city, leaving out people whose city is unknown.

--- edition2
query people_per_city() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city is not null }
  return { $p.city, count($p) as people }
  order { $p.city }
}

--- edition3
query people_per_city() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city is not null }
  return { $p.city, count($p) as people }
  order { $p.city }
}

--- expect ordered
columns: ["p.city","people"]
["Berlin",2]
["Madrid",1]
